WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.430
01 / Good ideas. Great company.
One workspace for teams, organizers, and judges.

00:00:01.430 --> 00:00:04.355
02 / The whole event, at a glance
Real project counts, review progress, and clear next steps.

00:00:04.355 --> 00:00:09.555
03 / Make room for your next event
Set the dates, tracks, and prizes with custom clay controls.

00:00:09.555 --> 00:00:15.860
04 / Build a team. Tell your story.
Draft your project before sharing it with the event.

00:00:15.860 --> 00:00:17.875
05 / Ready to share
Submit your project and make it discoverable in the gallery.

00:00:17.875 --> 00:00:19.825
06 / Give every project a fair review
Assign a balanced batch and keep track of completed reviews.

00:00:19.825 --> 00:00:26.000
07 / Thoughtful, private judging
Use the weighted rubric and leave useful feedback.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:28.730
08 / Publish a result everyone can trust
After the deadline, freeze the scores and export the results.

00:00:28.730 --> 00:00:30.095
09 / Celebrate the work
Visitors can explore projects and read the published scores.

00:00:30.095 --> 00:00:34.544
10 / A little room to play
Six arcade games. Your high scores stay in this browser.

00:00:34.544 --> 00:00:36.364
DOGFOOD / Make something that matters
Build together. Review thoughtfully. Keep everything moving.
